<view class="print-title">已配对的设备</view>
<view class="p-box">
  <view
    class="p-list"
    data-index="{{index}}"
    wx:if="{{storageList.length>0}}"
    wx:for="{{storageList}}"
    wx:key="index"
  >
    <view class="p-item">
      <view class="p-container">
        <image
          class="print-icon"
          mode="aspectFit"
          src="{{icon.imagePrint2}}"
        ></image>
        <view class="p-name" wx:if="{{item.remark}}"
          >{{item.remark}}（{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}）</view
        >
        <view class="p-name" wx:else
          >{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}</view
        >
      </view>
      <view class="p-add-right">
        <van-icon
          bindtap="showActionSheet"
          class="link-icon"
          data-qname="{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}"
          id="{{index}}"
          name="link-o"
        ></van-icon>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="no-print" wx:if="{{storageList.length==0}}">
    <image
      class="print-icon"
      mode="aspectFit"
      src="{{icon.imagePrint}}"
    ></image>
    <text>暂无{{spname}}</text>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="print-title"
  >可用设备<view bindtap="research" class="scan-print">
    <image
      class="print-icon"
      mode="aspectFit"
      src="{{icon.imageScanPrint}}"
    ></image
    >扫描{{spname}}</view
  >
</view>
<view class="p-box">
  <view
    class="p-list"
    data-index="{{index}}"
    wx:for="{{printList}}"
    wx:key="index"
  >
    <view bindtap="connectDevice" class="p-item" data-index="{{index}}">
      <view class="p-container">
        <image
          class="print-icon"
          mode="aspectFit"
          src="{{icon.imagePrint}}"
        ></image>
        <view class="p-name"
          >{{item.name=='未知设备'?item.localName:item.name}}</view
        >
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="no-print" wx:if="{{printList.length==0}}">
    <image
      class="print-icon"
      mode="aspectFit"
      src="{{icon.imagePrint}}"
    ></image>
    <text>暂无{{spname}}</text>
  </view>
</view>
<view class="print-title"
  >操作说明<van-icon
    bindtap="onShowExplain"
    class="question-o"
    name="question-o"
  ></van-icon>
</view>
<view class="box-tip">
  <view class="tip-item">1、打开{{spname}}，并使{{spname}}在唤醒状态；</view>
  <view class="tip-item"
    >2、打开手机蓝牙，部分安卓手机需要打开"定位"功能；</view
  >
  <view class="tip-item">3、点击扫描{{spname}}，选中{{spname}}后即可。</view>
</view>
<van-action-sheet
  bind:click-overlay="onShowExplain"
  bind:close="onShowExplain"
  class="explain_content"
  show="{{showExplain}}"
  title="打印说明"
>
  <view class="tip-box">
    <view class="tip-item-title">如遇无法连接</view>
    <view class="tip-item">1、检查{{spname}}是否唤醒；</view>
    <view class="tip-item">2、检查是否给与APP/微信/小程序蓝牙权限；</view>
    <view class="tip-item"
      >3、重启{{spname}}、重启蓝牙、重启微信、重启APP、重启手机；</view
    >
    <view class="tip-item">4、联系秉羲工作台客服，客服电话: 13360039559。</view>
    <view class="tip-item-title">其他说明</view>
    <view class="tip-item"
      >1、{{spname}}型号：HM-A300L、HM-A300S、HM-A350；</view
    >
    <view class="tip-item">2、纸张尺寸：</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（1）标签打印：70*40、60*40、38*30（双排）</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（2）色号打印：70*40、60*40、38*30（双排）</view>
    <view class="tip-item">（3）布头打印：60*80、80*100</view>
    <view class="tip-item"
      >3、纸张类型：热敏纸（如无法找到，可在淘宝搜索秉羲工作台）。</view
    >
  </view>
</van-action-sheet>
